</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Biomedical Literature Q&amp;A System Using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
